# Density Compare
# Bohrium (Bh) — real density 37.1 g/cm³. equal masses: Bohrium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Bohrium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.0mm color: #a080ff at (-20mm, 3.0mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 295.9 g — the water cube is the reference
